    _playerDescription: Rapid rivet rig with dependable pressure and range.
  - _role: 1
    _iconToken: HEAT
    _playerDescription: Focused furnace lance for durable priority targets.
  - _role: 2
    _iconToken: SAW
    _playerDescription: Sawblade relay for clustered salvage-yard pressure.
  - _role: 3
